<think>

</think>



Completion:
We are given two **arithmetic sequences**:

$$
\{a_n\}, \quad \{b_n\}
$$

Let the **first** sequence be:
$$
a_n = a + (n - 1)d, \quad \text{(arithmetic sequence with first term } a \text{ and common difference } d)
$$

